      "content": "hey i'm writing a tech piece about how ai is gonna wreck the job market in the next decade. i want to argue that universal basic income is basically the only way we survive this. can u give me a solid outline of the most convincing arguments for why UBI is the only viable solution to the coming job crisis?",
