    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "that's a good start. but i'm gonna get a lot of pushback from the usual crowd—people saying it's too expensive or that it'll just make everyone lazy. how should i frame those criticisms so they don't undermine my main point? like, how do i handle the arguments against it?",
